ef_paths":[],"statement":"Rotation discovery and Dynamic Clock observations do not establish candidate promotion or an investment action when the packet says promotion is not authorized.","status":"UNKNOWN"},{"claim_id":"numeric.official_release.summary_counts","kind":"FACT","source_ref_paths":["evidence/daily_briefing/evening/2026-09-11/rev-001/packet.json"],"statement":"The sealed packet reports official-release observations=1 and summary_items=5.","status":"VERIFIED"},{"claim_id":"date.official_release.observation_1","kind":"FACT","source_ref_paths":["evidence/daily_briefing/evening/2026-09-11/rev-001/packet.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/_manifest.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/sndkq4-26ex991xpressrelease.htm.gz"],"statement":"The retained official release for SNDK was published on 2026-08-05.","status":"VERIFIED"},{"claim_id":"official_release.attributed_summary_1","kind":"FACT","source_ref_paths":["evidence/daily_briefing/evening/2026-09-11/rev-001/packet.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/_manifest.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/sndkq4-26ex991xpressrelease.htm.gz"],"statement":"The retained official release states: Fiscal fourth quarter revenue was $8.97 billion, up 51% sequentially, with GAAP net income reported at $6.90 billion ($43.97 diluted net income per share). Sequential revenue growth came approximately one-third from higher volumes and two-thirds from higher pricing. Fourth quarter Non-GAAP diluted net income per share was $39.25.","status":"VERIFIED"},{"claim_id":"official_release.attributed_summary_2","kind":"FACT","source_ref_paths":["evidence/daily_briefing/evening/2026-09-11/rev-001/packet.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/_manifest.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/sndkq4-26ex991xpressrelease.htm.gz"],"statement":"The retained official release states: Fiscal year 2026 revenue was $20.25 billion, up 175% year-over-year, with GAAP net income reported at $11.43 billion ($73.76 diluted net income per share). Revenue outperformance was driven by both our mix shift toward higher-value customers, with Datacenter up 437%, and higher pricing. Fiscal year 2026 Non-GAAP diluted net income per share was $70.88.","status":"VERIFIED"},{"claim_id":"official_release.attributed_summary_3","kind":"FACT","source_ref_paths":["evidence/daily_briefing/evening/2026-09-11/rev-001/packet.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/_manifest.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/sndkq4-26ex991xpressrelease.htm.gz"],"statement":"The retained official release states: Since announcing five New Business Model (“NBM”) agreements during our April earnings call, we have signed five additional agreements, including three NBMs with new customers and two deals expanding on previously signed NBMs.","status":"VERIFIED"},{"claim_id":"official_release.attributed_summary_4","kind":"FACT","source_ref_paths":["evidence/daily_briefing/evening/2026-09-11/rev-001/packet.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/_manifest.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/sndkq4-26ex991xpressrelease.htm.gz"],"statement":"The retained official release states: Expanded our share repurchase authorization, with Sandisk’s Board of Directors approving an additional $14 billion buyback program, bringing total remaining authorization to $15.5 billion.","status":"VERIFIED"},{"claim_id":"official_release.attributed_summary_5","kind":"FACT","source_ref_paths":["evidence/daily_briefing/evening/2026-09-11/rev-001/packet.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/_manifest.json","data/sec_content/SNDK/0001628280-26-053346/sndkq4-26ex991xpressrelease.htm.gz"],"statement":"The retained official release states: Expect first quarter 2027 revenue to be in the range of $10.30 billion to $10.80 billion, with expected Non-GAAP diluted net income per share to be in the range of $44.00 to $46.00.","status":"VERIFIED"},{"claim_id":"boundary.